# SKB Format Specification v1.0

## I. SKB ANATOMY

```yaml
skb_structure:
  header:
    magic: "SKB1" (4 bytes)
    version: "1.0.0"
    
  authority:
    producer: ActorIdentity
    rights: [Read, Execute, Extend]
    signatures: [Ed25519, AES]
    
  manifest:
    title: string
    domain: string
    dependencies: [SKB URIs]
    
  semantic:
    nodes: [FAN URI nodes]
    edges: [Relation edges]
    
  memory:
    kv_cache: offset, size
    token_cache: offset, size
    embedding_cache: offset, size
    
  payload:
    type: [gguf, onnx, mlx, custom]
    offset: u64
    size: u64
    
  ports:
    - id: HP://port.id
      input: [string]
      output: [string]
      
  policy:
    allow: [string]
    deny: [string]
    audit: bool
```

## II. EFC DEFINITIONS

### EFC.Hacedle.Loader.SKB

```rust
pub trait SkbMountNep {
    fn verify(path: &Path) -> Result<SealInfo>;
    fn mmap(path: &Path) -> Result<MemoryProjection>;
    fn semantic_graph(proj: &MemoryProjection) -> Result<GraphView>;
    fn payload(proj: &MemoryProjection) -> Result<PayloadView>;
}
```

### EFA Mapping

```rust
pub trait SkbDispatchNep {
    fn select_executor(payload: PayloadView) -> ExecutorId;
    fn dispatch(payload: PayloadView) -> Result<ExecutionHandle>;
}
```

## III. RACIN Integration

- Memory-mapped via mmap()
- Zero-copy projection to Arena
- Authority gate enforced on access